{"schemaVersion":1,"id":"reference:bbf4ffdc29b0d2b7","name":"Power Generator","source":{"id":"source:reference-bbf4ffdc29b0d2b7","title":"Power Generator","revision":18413,"timestamp":"2024-08-25T20:05:34Z","sha256":"d285525a91bee0839a18edf72d3d008687e5307815f993737023dccb238d009a","url":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?oldid=18413","history":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?title=Power%20Generator&action=history"},"article":{"sourceId":"source:reference-bbf4ffdc29b0d2b7","blocks":[{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Reference Book: ",{"tag":"a","children":["Core Rulebook"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Core_Rulebook"}]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Cost:"]}," 750\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Weight:"]}," 15 Kilograms\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["A Power Generator is a small fusion reactor that provides continuous power for ",{"tag":"a","children":["Heavy Weapons"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Heavy_Weapons","referenceId":"reference:a2b1d4c4bac82300"},", ",{"tag":"a","children":["Vehicles"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Vehicles"},", structures, and machinery. It can power anything up to a Gargantuan ",{"tag":"a","children":["Vehicle"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Vehicle"}," or structure indefinitely, a Colossal ",{"tag":"a","children":["Vehicle"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Vehicle"}," or structure for 1 day, and a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Vehicle"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Vehicle"}," or structure of Colossal (Frigate) size for 1 hour. After that, it is ",{"tag":"a","children":["Disabled"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Disabled"}," and must be replaced.\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["If a Power Generator is destroyed while in use, its fusion reactor overloads and explodes, venting plasma into the surrounding area. When a Power Generator explodes, make an attack roll (1d20+10) against the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Reflex Defense"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Reflex_Defense"}," of every target within 4 squares. If the attack succeeds, the target takes 8d6 points of Energy damage. If the attack misses, the target takes half damage. A target with the ",{"tag":"b","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Evasion"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Evasion"}]}," Talent takes half damage if the attack succeeds, and no damage if the attack misses. This is an ",{"tag":"a","children":["Area Attack"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Area_Attack"},".\n"]},"\n","\n","\n","\n\n","\n\n","\n"]}}
